{"id":"segu_n","lemma":"según","pos":"prep","rank":677,"glosses":["according to","as, just as, the same way","depending on"],"ipa":"/seˈɡun/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-seg%C3%BAn.wav","examples":[{"text":"Siempre juego según las reglas.","en":"I always play by the rules.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581662"},{"text":"Según tu siembras, así recogerás.","en":"As you sow, so will you reap.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804158"},{"text":"Tom es, según parece, canadiense.","en":"Tom is apparently a Canadian.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352318"},{"text":"Todo salió según el plan.","en":"It all went according to plan.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152117"},{"text":"Según ella, él no vendrá.","en":"According to her, he won't come.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/633210"}]}